{
  "title": { "zh": "夜里的噪点", "en": "Night noise" },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "夜里拍的单据，噪点不只沿横向乱跳，上下也在跳。三点平均只管左右。",
        "en": "Documents photographed at night are noisy across and down alike. The three-point average only looks left and right."
      }
    }
  ],
  "after": {
    "zh": "先横着平均、再竖着平均，每格就和周围九格平均了：两次一维的平均拼成一次二维的，这叫<wiki-ref to=\"separable\"></wiki-ref>。",
    "en": "Averaging across, then down, averages each cell with the nine around it: two one-dimensional passes make one two-dimensional average. This is <wiki-ref to=\"separable\"></wiki-ref> filtering."
  },
